<title>KENYA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 305-8 V KENYA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 305-8 V KENYA.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa scored 305 for eight off their 50 overs in the one-day match against Kenya in the Kenyan centenary four-nation cricket tournament on Thursday.</p>
</text>
